{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734378",
      "title": "Deployment Steps",
      "sourceHash": "fbc9e08f251441c7fe91f0377f199ee401c727338d6242c81ab0b776da170eb5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.28,
          "end": 6.15,
          "en": "So how do you deploy our React application?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.15,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "How do you push it onto a real server?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 12.24,
          "en": "There are a couple of steps involved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.24,
          "end": 15.13,
          "en": "which you can go through whenever you deploy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.097,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "or redeploy your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 21.33,
          "en": "It all starts with writing your code, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.33,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "and then with testing your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 26.58,
          "en": "And this might sound obvious, but of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.58,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "you wanna thoroughly test your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 31.23,
          "en": "before you deploy it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 33.3,
          "en": "You wanna play around with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.3,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "test different things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "see if you handle errors correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "Things like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "You wanna make sure that you are shipping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 44.463,
          "en": "an application which is ready to be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.3,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "Then as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 51.33,
          "en": "you might wanna explore optimization opportunities.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.33,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "There are certain things in your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "which you can optimize.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 56.73,
          "en": "Most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.73,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "you might wanna look into a concept called lazy loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "And we are going to explore this concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "in this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.41,
          "en": "So that is another important part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 72.033,
          "en": "before you actually move your code somewhere, optimize it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.59,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "Now once you're happy with your code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "it's optimized and it's working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "then it's time to build your app for production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "And with build,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 86.85,
          "en": "I don't mean that you need to write more code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.85,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "but instead, we will execute a script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 91.98,
          "en": "which was written for us already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.98,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "which is part of this React project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "we worked with throughout discourse.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 99.3,
          "en": "A script which will then output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.3,
          "end": 103.17,
          "en": "a production ready bundle of our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 106.44,
          "en": "which is unified and automatically optimized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.44,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "to be as small as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "So that we get an output there which we can take like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "and move onto a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 118.97999999999999,
          "en": "And will then automatically serve our users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.97999999999999,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "a highly optimized code package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "which is as small as possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 126.96,
          "en": "which, of course, matters because we wanna ship",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.96,
          "end": 130.35,
          "en": "as little code as possible to our users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 132.84,
          "en": "because they will only be able to interact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.84,
          "end": 135.45,
          "en": "with our website once it's fully loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "So shipping less code will load the app faster,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 141.69,
          "en": "and therefore is better, and we'll be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.69,
          "end": 144.6,
          "en": "to automatically generate such a optimized,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.6,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "minified code bundle with a certain script,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 151.14,
          "en": "which we are also going to see in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.14,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "in this core section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.12,
          "en": "Now, once we get this optimized code package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.12,
          "end": 158.22,
          "en": "which is ready for deployment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.22,
          "end": 160.38,
          "en": "we need to deploy that package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.38,
          "end": 163.74,
          "en": "and therefore the next step is that we take that code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.74,
          "end": 165.69,
          "en": "which is produced for us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.69,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "which is based on the code we wrote, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "and upload it to a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 173.94,
          "en": "Now there we'll have different choices,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.94,
          "end": 176.61,
          "en": "different hosting providers which we can use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.61,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "and I'll show an example in this core section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 181.74,
          "en": "but you can really deploy it anywhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "I'll just leave a couple of notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 186.81,
          "en": "on what matters there and what you should keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 189.75,
          "en": "when it comes to deploying your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 189.75,
          "end": 193.59,
          "en": "You will definitely need to configure your server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.59,
          "end": 196.74,
          "en": "or your hosting provider's offering,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 196.74,
          "end": 199.17000000000002,
          "en": "and I'll dive into this configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 199.17000000000002,
          "end": 202.07999999999998,
          "en": "together with you in this core section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.07999999999998,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "to make it crystal clear what matters here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "what you should pay attention to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 209.4,
          "en": "and how you do configure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209.4,
          "end": 213.453,
          "en": "and ultimately, deploy your code and your server correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}